The [[Hedgehog]] is an epic [[Pet]] available in the shop for [[Ranger]]s with the [[Big Bowl of Treats]]. Every so often, it deals some damage, which increases the more {{icon/spikes}}s the player has. Once the player takes some damage, it also gives some {{icon/block}} and {{icon/spikes}} once. It triggers faster the more [[Pet]]s and [[Food]]s are adjacent, but unlike most [[Pet]]s or [[Food]]s that care about these things, it only counts the items in front of it or below its feet. (Maybe pets don't much like the idea of getting poked by those spines, and maybe someone similarly wouldn't want to eat a spiney meal?)

The [[Hedgehog]] can be combined with a [[Heroic Potion]] to become the [[Hyper Hedgehog]], which is better in every way.
